---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const bookUrl = 'https://calendar.notion.so/meet/cameronearloliver/qc3y04oud';
---

<Layout
  title="Fractional COO for Owner-Led Businesses, $1M–$20M | Growth Map"
  description="Your business can't grow without you? I find the one constraint capping growth and fix it with your team. Operating partner / fractional COO for owner-led businesses, $1M–$20M."
  canonicalPath="/"
>
  <!-- 1 · HERO -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-hairline px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    <svg class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-36 -top-16 h-[640px] w-[640px] text-moss opacity-40" viewBox="0 0 600 600" aria-hidden="true">
      <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.75">
        <path d="M300,80 C420,70 520,160 530,280 C540,400 460,520 330,530 C200,540 80,460 75,320 C70,180 180,90 300,80 Z" />
        <path d="M300,130 C390,122 470,190 478,285 C486,380 420,470 320,478 C220,486 128,420 124,310 C120,200 210,138 300,130 Z" />
        <path d="M300,180 C365,174 420,222 426,290 C432,358 385,420 312,426 C239,432 176,384 173,305 C170,226 235,186 300,180 Z" />
        <circle cx="299" cy="301" r="5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
      </g>
    </svg>
    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto grid max-w-[1200px] items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] md:gap-14">
      <div>
        <p class="mb-4 font-mono text-[11.5px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-moss">Operating partner · Owner-led businesses · $1M–$20M</p>
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl leading-[1.08] text-ink sm:text-5xl md:text-[58px]">
          Your business can't grow <em>without you.</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-[48ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-fern">
          You're working harder than ever and the needle stopped moving. That's not a hustle problem. It's one constraint you can't see from the inside. I find it, and fix it with your team. No deck. No workshop.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8">
          <a href={bookUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block rounded-full border border-ink bg-ink px-8 py-4 text-[15px] font-semibold text-parchment transition-opacity hover:opacity-90">
            Book a call
          </a>
          <p class="mt-3.5 text-sm text-fern">Free, 30 minutes. Bring your numbers. If I can't help, I'll say so.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-center md:justify-end">
        <figure class="max-w-[300px]">
          <img src="/images/headshot.jpeg" alt="Cameron Oliver, Growth Map" class="w-full rounded-[16px] border border-hairline shadow-sm" loading="eager" />
          <figcaption class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-fern">
            Cameron Oliver · operator, not a theorist
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2 · PROOF BAR -->
  <section class="border-b border-hairline bg-ink px-6 py-8">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1200px] flex-col items-center justify-between gap-y-6 text-center md:flex-row md:text-left">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-x-8 lg:gap-x-12">
        <div>
          <p class="font-display text-xl leading-tight text-cream md:text-[26px]">Margin recovered</p>
          <p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-cream/60">in a single quarter</p>
        </div>
        <div class="h-9 w-px flex-shrink-0 bg-cream/20"></div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-display text-xl leading-tight text-cream md:text-[26px]">Throughput doubled</p>
          <p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-cream/60">same headcount</p>
        </div>
        <div class="h-9 w-px flex-shrink-0 bg-cream/20"></div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-display text-xl leading-tight text-cream md:text-[26px]">10+ years</p>
          <p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-cream/60">operating, #3 → 100+</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-cream/60">Construction · Telehealth · SaaS · PE</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3 · THE PROBLEM (demoted hook lives here) -->
  <section class="border-b border-hairline px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[820px]">
      <p class="doc-label text-ink">The trap</p>
      <h2 class="font-display mt-7 text-3xl leading-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
        You're fixing the <em>wrong thing.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-fern">
        When growth stalls, you push harder on what you can see. More sales pressure. Another hire. A new tool. A year later you're more tired and no less stuck, because the real constraint was never the thing you were working on, and from inside the business you can't see it.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-fern">
        You're still the one every decision runs through. That's the job: find the one thing actually holding you back, and take it off your plate for good.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 · HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section class="border-b border-hairline bg-parchment-deep px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1100px]">
      <p class="doc-label text-ink">How it works</p>
      <div class="mt-9 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/60 p-7">
          <p class="font-mono text-3xl font-medium text-moss">01</p>
          <h3 class="font-display mt-3 text-[22px] text-ink">I read your numbers</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-fern">Your real data, in context. Not a survey of what your team thinks is wrong.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/60 p-7">
          <p class="font-mono text-3xl font-medium text-moss">02</p>
          <h3 class="font-display mt-3 text-[22px] text-ink">I find the one constraint</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-fern">The single thing capping growth, named and quantified so you know what it's costing you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/60 p-7">
          <p class="font-mono text-3xl font-medium text-moss">03</p>
          <h3 class="font-display mt-3 text-[22px] text-ink">I fix it</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-fern">Alongside your team, until it holds without me. Not a plan I hand you and leave.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="font-display mt-9 text-[22px] italic leading-snug text-ink">
        Consultants stop at 02. Coaches skip 01. <span class="text-moss">I do all three.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-[64ch] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-fern">
        And when the fix needs software, I build it, real operating systems and AI agents, not slideware. <a href="/about" class="font-semibold text-moss transition-colors hover:text-ink">See what I've built →</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5 · PROOF (scorecard + 2 cases + quotes) -->
  <section class="border-b border-hairline px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px]">
      <p class="doc-label text-ink">Proof</p>
      <h2 class="font-display mt-7 text-3xl leading-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
        What it does to a business.
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-8 grid items-start gap-8 md:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] md:gap-12">
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/60 p-7">
          <p class="mb-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium tracking-[0.14em] text-fern">SAMPLE SCORECARD</p>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-dashed border-hairline py-2.5 text-[13.5px] font-medium text-fern first:border-t-0">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="h-2 w-2 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background:#5C7A3B"></span>Revenue vs. plan</span><span class="font-mono text-sm text-ink">103%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-dashed border-hairline py-2.5 text-[13.5px] font-medium text-fern">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="h-2 w-2 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background:#C08A2D"></span>Cash collected</span><span class="font-mono text-sm text-ink">88%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-dashed border-hairline py-2.5 text-[13.5px] font-medium text-fern">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="h-2 w-2 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background:#5C7A3B"></span>Gross margin</span><span class="font-mono text-sm text-ink">42%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-dashed border-hairline py-2.5 text-[13.5px] font-medium text-fern">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="h-2 w-2 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background:#5C7A3B"></span>Closed-won rate</span><span class="font-mono text-sm text-ink">31%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-dashed border-hairline py-2.5 text-[13.5px] font-medium text-fern">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="h-2 w-2 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background:#C08A2D"></span>Net Promoter Score</span><span class="font-mono text-sm text-ink">41</span>
          </div>
          <p class="font-display mt-4 text-sm italic text-fern">The weekly scorecard your team runs without you. Your metrics, not these.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/50 p-7">
            <p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-moss">Construction</p>
            <div class="mt-4 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3">
              <div><p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-fern">The business</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink">A framing contractor, booked solid, but the owner approved every change order and jobs closed under bid.</p></div>
              <div><p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-fern">What I found</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink">Not a pricing problem. Change orders got billed weeks late or never. Money walked off the job site.</p></div>
              <div><p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-fern">The result</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink">Same-day change orders in the foremen's hands. Margin recovered in a quarter. Owner off the critical path.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/50 p-7">
            <p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-moss">Teledermatology</p>
            <div class="mt-4 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3">
              <div><p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-fern">The business</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink">A group running thousands of async visits a month. Growing, but clinicians were drowning in messages.</p></div>
              <div><p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-fern">What I found</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink">Not a staffing problem. Messages hit the wrong queue and got re-triaged two or three times before anyone acted.</p></div>
              <div><p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-fern">The result</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink">One routing change cut response from days to hours. Same headcount, roughly double the throughput.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/50 p-7">
          <p class="text-moss">★★★★★</p>
          <blockquote class="font-display mt-2 text-[16px] italic leading-normal text-ink">"Straight shooter. Told me the problem was me, not my crews, and he was right. Best money I've spent on the business side of this company."</blockquote>
          <cite class="mt-4 block font-mono text-[11px] not-italic tracking-wide text-fern">Tony · Owner</cite>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/50 p-7">
          <p class="text-moss">★★★★★</p>
          <blockquote class="font-display mt-2 text-[16px] italic leading-normal text-ink">"I'd hired consultants before and gotten a 60-page deck I never opened. Cameron gave me three changes I could make that week. All three worked."</blockquote>
          <cite class="mt-4 block font-mono text-[11px] not-italic tracking-wide text-fern">Priya · CEO</cite>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/50 p-7">
          <p class="text-moss">★★★★★</p>
          <blockquote class="font-display mt-2 text-[16px] italic leading-normal text-ink">"He rebuilt our operating cadence from the ground up. Faster diligence, shorter board meetings, and I finally trust the dashboard I'm looking at."</blockquote>
          <cite class="mt-4 block font-mono text-[11px] not-italic tracking-wide text-fern">Alicia · CEO</cite>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6 · WHO IT'S FOR -->
  <section class="border-b border-hairline px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1000px]">
      <p class="doc-label text-ink">Is this you?</p>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/50 p-7">
          <p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-moss">Yes, if</p>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3">
            {[
              "You own a $1–20M business and you're still the bottleneck.",
              "You'd rather hear the truth from your numbers than a pep talk.",
              "You're ready to change how the business actually runs.",
            ].map((item) => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink">
                <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-moss"></span>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/30 p-7">
          <p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-fern">Not yet, if</p>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3">
            {[
              "You're pre-revenue and still hunting for product-market fit.",
              "You want someone to agree with you, not tell you what's wrong.",
              "You're not willing to change how decisions get made.",
            ].map((item) => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-fern">
                <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-fern/50"></span>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 7 · FINAL CTA -->
  <section class="px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[720px] text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl leading-tight text-ink md:text-[40px]">
        Find out what's really capping your growth.
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div><p class="font-mono text-sm font-medium text-moss">01 We talk</p><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-fern">Free 30 minutes. A straight read on what's capping you, hire me or not.</p></div>
        <div><p class="font-mono text-sm font-medium text-moss">02 I send a plan</p><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-fern">What I see in your numbers, and how we'd work, month-to-month.</p></div>
        <div><p class="font-mono text-sm font-medium text-moss">03 You decide</p><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-fern">One fixed monthly fee. No hourly meter, no retainer trap.</p></div>
      </div>
      <a href={bookUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-9 inline-block rounded-full border border-ink bg-ink px-9 py-4 text-[15px] font-semibold text-parchment transition-opacity hover:opacity-90">
        Book a call
      </a>
      <p class="mt-3.5 text-sm text-fern">Bring your numbers. If I can't help, I'll say so.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
